# Control-channel script for this app's sim row (sim-run.sh::run_test, sim
# rows only): two swipes across the page, each once the app says it is ready
# for one. `wait <regex>` blocks until the log matches; every other line goes
# to the simulator's control channel as typed, the verbs `pdb input` takes on
# hardware. The first swipe (right to left) must turn to page 1, the second
# (left to right) back to page 0.
wait PagerDemo[]:] ready for swipe left
input swipe 220 100 40 100 150
wait PagerDemo[]:] ready for swipe right
input swipe 40 100 220 100 150
